<!doctype lake><title>教案02-第一个C程序</title><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="fixed" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><h1 data-lake-id="iquhG" id="iquhG"><span data-lake-id="ube509a21" id="ube509a21">1.Hello World</span></h1><h2 data-lake-id="GArlx" id="GArlx"><span data-lake-id="u6b8b3663" id="u6b8b3663">1.1 Hello World示例</span></h2><p data-lake-id="acfb378796caec0b8a14ed57adda920d" id="acfb378796caec0b8a14ed57adda920d"><span data-lake-id="u0f49d1a0" id="u0f49d1a0" class="lake-fontsize-12">学习一门新程序设计语言的惟一途径就是使用它编写程序。对于所有语言的初学者来说， 编写的第一个程序几乎都是相同的：</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cnint%20main()%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22Hello%20World%5C%5Cn%5C%22)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%200%3B%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22t2RhY%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="ed395ce3f5001796f7d9adf3c3541e44" id="ed395ce3f5001796f7d9adf3c3541e44"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560083350-10164640-50a3-4bee-89d8-2b5c1a19cc09.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A250%2C%22height%22%3A257%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A500%2C%22originHeight%22%3A513%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23c2c2c2%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tB6p1%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="4d80d9a8ae42d55d7280aeddf72b9e1f" id="4d80d9a8ae42d55d7280aeddf72b9e1f"><span data-lake-id="ue99ab2c5" id="ue99ab2c5" class="lake-fontsize-12">一个 C 语言程序，无论其大小如何，都是由</span><span data-lake-id="u2a7b9c90" id="u2a7b9c90" class="lake-fontsize-12">函数和变量</span><span data-lake-id="u6d979b25" id="u6d979b25" class="lake-fontsize-12">组成的。</span></p><p data-lake-id="4e2f4adca5c195221a22eae3af6ae51a" id="4e2f4adca5c195221a22eae3af6ae51a"><span data-lake-id="u3bba72f5" id="u3bba72f5" class="lake-fontsize-12">函数中包含一些语句，以指定所要执行的计算操作；</span></p><p data-lake-id="8d7ecdc2d812fbb4661648e55517b6e5" id="8d7ecdc2d812fbb4661648e55517b6e5"><span data-lake-id="uc19dfe4a" id="uc19dfe4a" class="lake-fontsize-12">变量则用于存储计算过程中使用的值。</span></p><p data-lake-id="c3b41aa5bd4947e79ef01b313aeb26d4" id="c3b41aa5bd4947e79ef01b313aeb26d4"><span data-lake-id="u164b2986" id="u164b2986" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="7c3972bddac095a05f470dbb1bf793e3" id="7c3972bddac095a05f470dbb1bf793e3"><span data-lake-id="u4ff57d9e" id="u4ff57d9e" class="lake-fontsize-12">在本例中，函数的名字为 main。通常情况下，函数的命名没有限制，但 main 是一 个特殊的函数名——每个程序都从 main 函数的起点开始执行，函数中的语句用一对花括号{}括起来。</span></p><p data-lake-id="2e6bc9c9218c9fc38bbdacc55fce1925" id="2e6bc9c9218c9fc38bbdacc55fce1925"><span data-lake-id="u02820c54" id="u02820c54" class="lake-fontsize-12">主函数是</span><span data-lake-id="u60ded9c7" id="u60ded9c7" class="lake-fontsize-12">必须有的</span><span data-lake-id="uc6696f61" id="uc6696f61" class="lake-fontsize-12">，每一个C语言程序都有main函数，哪怕是空的。</span></p><p data-lake-id="6f933e9e951c46194ac68bf7b7778984" id="6f933e9e951c46194ac68bf7b7778984"><span data-lake-id="ube91f41f" id="ube91f41f" class="lake-fontsize-12">主函数是程序的入口，也就是程序开始运行的地方。</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22int%20main()%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%200%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cn%2F*%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%3A%20%E8%BF%94%E5%9B%9E%E5%80%BC%E7%B1%BB%E5%9E%8B%EF%BC%8C%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E4%B8%BB%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E6%9C%80%E7%BB%88%E7%9A%84%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E6%95%B4%E5%9E%8B%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%5Cn%20%20%20%20main%3A%20%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E7%9A%84%E5%90%8D%E5%AD%97%EF%BC%8C%E8%BF%99%E4%B8%AA%E5%90%8D%E5%AD%97%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E5%8F%98%5Cn%20%20%20%20(void)%EF%BC%9A%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E7%9A%84%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B0%E5%88%97%E8%A1%A8%EF%BC%8C%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E8%BF%90%E8%A1%8C%E6%97%B6%E4%B8%8D%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B0%EF%BC%8C%E7%AD%89%E4%BB%B7%E4%BA%8E()%EF%BC%8C%E6%AD%A4%E5%A4%84void%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E7%9C%81%E7%95%A5%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%200%EF%BC%9A%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E7%9A%84%E8%BF%94%E5%9B%9E%E5%80%BC%EF%BC%8C%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E4%B8%BB%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E6%9C%80%E7%BB%88%E8%BF%94%E5%9B%9E%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%200%20%E7%BB%99%E4%B8%8A%E7%BA%A7%E8%BF%9B%E7%A8%8B%EF%BC%88%E7%A7%B0%E4%B8%BA%E7%88%B6%E8%BF%9B%E7%A8%8B%EF%BC%89%E3%80%82%5Cn%20%20%20%20%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E8%80%8C%E8%A8%80%EF%BC%8C%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%E6%AD%A3%E5%B8%B8%E9%80%80%E5%87%BA%E8%BF%94%E5%9B%9E0%EF%BC%8C%E9%9D%9E%E6%AD%A3%E5%B8%B8%E9%80%80%E5%87%BA%E8%BF%94%E5%9B%9E%E9%9D%9E0%E3%80%82%5Cn*%2F%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KGL8c%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="3eeb441883ea4df249aa7f7cc6b97ac5" id="3eeb441883ea4df249aa7f7cc6b97ac5"><span data-lake-id="u872c4662" id="u872c4662" class="lake-fontsize-12">本例中的 main 函数仅包含下面一条语句：</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22printf(%5C%22hello%2C%20world%5C%5Cn%5C%22)%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GKvom%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="fd231c68ed54964478aec2fb97f72f45" id="fd231c68ed54964478aec2fb97f72f45"><span data-lake-id="ub4d73d2e" id="ub4d73d2e" class="lake-fontsize-12">printf 是一个用于打印输出的</span><span data-lake-id="u880a5849" id="u880a5849" class="lake-fontsize-12">库函数</span><span data-lake-id="u34f3e642" id="u34f3e642" class="lake-fontsize-12">，在此处， 它打印双引号中间的</span><span data-lake-id="u35e5bd53" id="u35e5bd53" class="lake-fontsize-12">字符串</span><span data-lake-id="u9a251f62" id="u9a251f62" class="lake-fontsize-12">，&quot;\n&quot;表示换行的意思。</span></p><p data-lake-id="86002041197ac816da2e746f3f2a432d" id="86002041197ac816da2e746f3f2a432d"><span data-lake-id="u2698d5d1" id="u2698d5d1" class="lake-fontsize-12">头文件</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cn1.%E4%B8%BA%E4%BB%80%E4%B9%88%E8%A6%81%E5%8C%85%E5%90%AB%E5%A4%B4%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%9F%5Cn2.%E4%B8%BA%E4%BB%80%E4%B9%88%E5%9C%A8%E8%BF%99%E4%B8%AA%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E9%87%8C%E8%A6%81%E5%8C%85%E5%90%ABstdio.h%E8%BF%99%E4%B8%AA%E5%A4%B4%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%9F%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22s2otl%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="19dfd971e6ae2642c13d9cf9e62538f7" id="19dfd971e6ae2642c13d9cf9e62538f7"><span data-lake-id="u7a9f4291" id="u7a9f4291" class="lake-fontsize-12">C语言程序中，任何符号（包括变量和函数）的使用，都是需要提前声明的。</span></p><p data-lake-id="29160c583db6c6afa908f8ebe85f7c32" id="29160c583db6c6afa908f8ebe85f7c32"><span data-lake-id="u029d8fa3" id="u029d8fa3" class="lake-fontsize-12">经过声明的符号，编译器才能正确识别和编译，否则编译器不认识，无法编译</span></p><p data-lake-id="664a59848ae2d5b21bff7df84a5ffe80" id="664a59848ae2d5b21bff7df84a5ffe80"><span data-lake-id="u7d291561" id="u7d291561" class="lake-fontsize-12">如果程序用到了系统库函数，那么就需要包含相应的系统头文件来进行声明。</span></p><p data-lake-id="f45b5c032b5385a97cc67f000bfdda85" id="f45b5c032b5385a97cc67f000bfdda85"><span data-lake-id="u0cc8205f" id="u0cc8205f" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><h2 data-lake-id="m77X9" id="m77X9"><span data-lake-id="u47cd12c5" id="u47cd12c5">1.2 man（manual）手册</span></h2><p data-lake-id="e3b4fccb01fdbe8eb5294118aa4954b7" id="e3b4fccb01fdbe8eb5294118aa4954b7"><span data-lake-id="u27a4f838" id="u27a4f838" class="lake-fontsize-12">手册类别：</span></p><ul list="u2d154c75"><li fid="u4f8ff442" data-lake-id="uc7fd4de7" id="uc7fd4de7"><span data-lake-id="u340d3c98" id="u340d3c98" class="lake-fontsize-12">Shell命令（默认已安装）</span></li><li fid="u4f8ff442" data-lake-id="u298f53c4" id="u298f53c4"><span data-lake-id="u4934ee20" id="u4934ee20" class="lake-fontsize-12">系统调用</span></li><li fid="u4f8ff442" data-lake-id="ue8b85686" id="ue8b85686"><span data-lake-id="u4011b310" id="u4011b310" class="lake-fontsize-12">库函数</span></li><li fid="u4f8ff442" data-lake-id="ue77af1a6" id="ue77af1a6"><span data-lake-id="uae55d551" id="uae55d551" class="lake-fontsize-12">特殊文件（通常出现在/dev目录下）</span></li><li fid="u4f8ff442" data-lake-id="u3668e6da" id="u3668e6da"><span data-lake-id="u1e2c83cd" id="u1e2c83cd" class="lake-fontsize-12">文件的特殊格式或协定（例如/etc/passwd的格式）</span></li><li fid="u4f8ff442" data-lake-id="u89b2a756" id="u89b2a756"><span data-lake-id="u41ae6fcf" id="u41ae6fcf" class="lake-fontsize-12">游戏</span></li><li fid="u4f8ff442" data-lake-id="u001a5781" id="u001a5781"><span data-lake-id="u92d38f53" id="u92d38f53" class="lake-fontsize-12">杂项（例如一些宏定义）</span></li><li fid="u4f8ff442" data-lake-id="u50183e3c" id="u50183e3c"><span data-lake-id="ucabf9262" id="ucabf9262" class="lake-fontsize-12">系统管理员命令（通常只能由管理员执行）</span></li><li fid="u4f8ff442" data-lake-id="ufb2872c7" id="ufb2872c7"><span data-lake-id="u7f8ba3e5" id="u7f8ba3e5" class="lake-fontsize-12">非标准内核例程</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u66e66423" id="u66e66423"><span data-lake-id="u720888cc" id="u720888cc" class="lake-fontsize-12">在默认情况下，系统只安装第一册，其他的帮助信息一般需要用户自己手动安装，安装指令如下：</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22gec%40ubuntu%3A~%24%20sudo%20apt%20install%20manpages-zh%5Cngec%40ubuntu%3A~%24%20sudo%20apt%20install%20manpages-dev%5Cngec%40ubuntu%3A~%24%20sudo%20apt%20install%20manpages-posix%5Cngec%40ubuntu%3A~%24%20sudo%20apt%20install%20manpages-posix-dev%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DYGBC%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="af665b72d071600f9ccc92399db36d29" id="af665b72d071600f9ccc92399db36d29"><span data-lake-id="ue81e8f0e" id="ue81e8f0e" class="lake-fontsize-12">查询man手册（</span><em><span data-lake-id="uf9a2eeb7" id="uf9a2eeb7" class="lake-fontsize-12">按 q退出</span></em><span data-lake-id="u68990d75" id="u68990d75" class="lake-fontsize-12">）</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22liuth%40ubuntu%3A~%24%20man%20-f%20printf%5Cnprintf%20(1)%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20-%20format%20and%20print%20data%5Cnprintf%20(1posix)%20%20%20%20%20%20-%20write%20formatted%20output%5Cnprintf%20(3)%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20-%20formatted%20output%20conversion%5Cnprintf%20(3posix)%20%20%20%20%20%20-%20print%20formatted%20output%5Cnliuth%40ubuntu%3A~%24%20man%203%20printf%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vUwtv%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><h2 data-lake-id="SjLFk" id="SjLFk"><span data-lake-id="u8c0a4de5" id="u8c0a4de5">1.3 printf</span></h2><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22int%20printf(const%20char%20*format%2C%20...)%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Mywpl%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="34314d8356b1fafeb88e26b1cd626792" id="34314d8356b1fafeb88e26b1cd626792"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf125f2e3" id="uf125f2e3" class="lake-fontsize-12">printf 的格式有四种：</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="d3aaadd3083b2369e1fba945b8773245" id="d3aaadd3083b2369e1fba945b8773245"><span data-lake-id="u5975ee50" id="u5975ee50" class="lake-fontsize-12">---printf(&quot;hello\n&quot;);</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22printf(%5C%22Hello%20World!%5C%5Cn%5C%22)%3B%2F%2F%E5%85%B6%E4%B8%AD%20n%20%E6%98%AF%E2%80%9Cnew%20line%E2%80%9D%E7%9A%84%E7%BC%A9%E5%86%99%EF%BC%8C%E5%8D%B3%E2%80%9C%E6%96%B0%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%80%E8%A1%8C%E2%80%9D%E3%80%82%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uuN7w%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="0558c153001ba1ac2477b37b972900c9" id="0558c153001ba1ac2477b37b972900c9"><span data-lake-id="u4cfa67c8" id="u4cfa67c8" class="lake-fontsize-12">---printf(&quot;输出控制符&quot;，输出参数); </span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cnint%20main(void)%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20i%20%3D%2010%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20i)%3B%20%2F*%20%25d%E6%98%AF%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E7%AC%A6%EF%BC%8Cd%20%E8%A1%A8%E7%A4%BA%E5%8D%81%E8%BF%9B%E5%88%B6%EF%BC%8C%E5%90%8E%E9%9D%A2%E7%9A%84%20i%20%E6%98%AF%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B0*%2F%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%200%3B%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YqOk3%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><ul list="ufc9df4ec"><li fid="u043401f8" data-lake-id="u4ae6628e" id="u4ae6628e"><span data-lake-id="u243de53f" id="u243de53f" class="lake-fontsize-12">这句话的意思是将变量 i 以十进制输出。</span></li><li fid="u043401f8" data-lake-id="ua8b24b82" id="ua8b24b82"><span data-lake-id="u6085102f" id="u6085102f" class="lake-fontsize-12">%x就是以十六进制的形式输出</span></li><li fid="u043401f8" data-lake-id="u60df0c82" id="u60df0c82"><span data-lake-id="ueadfefac" id="ueadfefac" class="lake-fontsize-12">%o就是以八进制的形式输出</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="65558aef9a85d6840f4b7b3162c89bc4" id="65558aef9a85d6840f4b7b3162c89bc4"><span data-lake-id="u0593f044" id="u0593f044" class="lake-fontsize-12">---printf(&quot;输出控制符1 输出控制符2…&quot;, 输出参数1, 输出参数2, …);</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cnint%20main(void)%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20i%20%3D%2010%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20j%20%3D%203%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20printf(%5C%22%25d%20%25d%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20i%2C%20j)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%200%3B%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bCtaP%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><ul list="ufd61e2c5"><li fid="u77c068ab" data-lake-id="u848bc3ba" id="u848bc3ba"><span data-lake-id="ua9bd9bbf" id="ua9bd9bbf" class="lake-fontsize-12">输出控制符 1 对应的是输出参数 1，输出控制符 2 对应的是输出参数 2</span></li><li fid="u77c068ab" data-lake-id="u4f262316" id="u4f262316"><span data-lake-id="u302d8654" id="u302d8654" class="lake-fontsize-12">%d 和 %d之间有空格,那么输出10 和 3 之间就有空格，printf 中双引号内除了输出控制符和转义字符\n外，所有其余的普通字符全部都原样输出</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="16d07ef108ef5b7a93d1f14d3be61a88" id="16d07ef108ef5b7a93d1f14d3be61a88"><span data-lake-id="ua87d0ad4" id="ua87d0ad4" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="533d26609356dc45bc6c0cc09c1a5df7" id="533d26609356dc45bc6c0cc09c1a5df7"><span data-lake-id="u482cf540" id="u482cf540" class="lake-fontsize-12">---printf(&quot;输出控制符 非输出控制符&quot;，输出参数);</span></p><p data-lake-id="b63dbd4f7edee44eddd1bc9311900b05" id="b63dbd4f7edee44eddd1bc9311900b05"><span data-lake-id="u3bc79b25" id="u3bc79b25" class="lake-fontsize-12">输出控制符如下：</span></p><p data-lake-id="949e21a6871a151d5c29a47730973160" id="949e21a6871a151d5c29a47730973160"><span data-lake-id="u68f538e3" id="u68f538e3" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="4a64e2c16af73d3d1f01e006db498abd" id="4a64e2c16af73d3d1f01e006db498abd"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560083559-25d3af17-78da-4357-b40b-56e8e81255c8.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A515%2C%22height%22%3A457%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A609%2C%22originHeight%22%3A540%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23ebebeb%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UOUvu%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="62e62d42a8295002982aadc2ef460d48" id="62e62d42a8295002982aadc2ef460d48"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560083835-3835933a-7365-4638-b3ba-24b21392737d.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A547%2C%22height%22%3A644%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A609%2C%22originHeight%22%3A717%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23e8e8e8%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Zq6im%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id="BHhVg" id="BHhVg"><span data-lake-id="u1225535c" id="u1225535c">1.4 scanf</span></h2><p data-lake-id="b7189dfb1a87e9ef2c816e4620639ddd" id="b7189dfb1a87e9ef2c816e4620639ddd"><span data-lake-id="u402dd187" id="u402dd187" class="lake-fontsize-12">键盘是系统的标准输入设备，从键盘中输入数据被称为标准输入</span></p><p data-lake-id="81ac7d0dd9e518821f3250f5a60d962f" id="81ac7d0dd9e518821f3250f5a60d962f"><span data-lake-id="ub52ffbf4" id="ub52ffbf4" class="lake-fontsize-12">3个标准输入输出：标准输入：键盘、标准输出：屏幕、标准出错：屏幕</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22int%20scanf(const%20char%20*format%2C%20...)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20format%EF%BC%9A%E6%A0%BC%E5%BC%8F%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E7%AC%A6%EF%BC%88%25f%E3%80%81%25zu%EF%BC%89%5Cn%20%20%20%20...%EF%BC%9A%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E5%AD%98%E5%82%A8%E8%BE%93%E5%85%A5%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E7%9A%84%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%E5%9C%B0%E5%9D%80%5Cn----%E3%80%8B%E6%88%90%E5%8A%9F%EF%BC%9A%E8%AF%BB%E5%8F%96%E5%88%B0%E7%9A%84%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E4%B8%AA%E6%95%B0%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SfWQ1%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="u2d137f51" id="u2d137f51"><span data-lake-id="u324d6659" id="u324d6659" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">对于 scanf()，不管用户输入多少内容，只要不按下回车键，就不进行真正的读取。这是因为 scanf() 是带有行缓冲的，用户输入的内容会先放入缓冲区，直到用户按下回车键，产生换行符</span><code data-lake-id="u5dfebb20" id="u5dfebb20"><span data-lake-id="u0aeb301b" id="u0aeb301b" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">\n</span></code><span data-lake-id="u63de6d31" id="u63de6d31" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51)">，才会刷新缓冲区，进行真正的读取。同时换行符会有残留（特殊情况：%d 等会自动跳过空白字符：空格、\n，仅有%c 会拿取所有字符）</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22int%20b%2Cc%3B%5Cnchar%20a%5B10%5D%3B%5Cnscanf(%5C%22%25d%5C%22%2C%26b)%3B%2F%2F%E8%BF%99%E9%87%8C%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%26%5Cnscanf(%5C%22%25d%20%25d%5C%22%2C%26b%2C%26c)%2F%2F%E5%88%86%E9%9A%94%E7%AC%A6%EF%BC%9A%E7%A9%BA%E6%A0%BC%E3%80%81%E5%9B%9E%E8%BD%A6%E3%80%81TAB%5Cnscanf(%5C%22%25d%5C%22%2Ca)%3B%2F%2F%E8%BF%99%E9%87%8C%E4%B8%8D%E7%94%A8%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%26%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fTy5p%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><p data-lake-id="u5cb9fcfe" id="u5cb9fcfe"><span data-lake-id="u5694aca6" id="u5694aca6" class="lake-fontsize-12">如果：</span></p><card type="inline" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22scanf(%5C%22%25d%5C%22%2C%26a)%3B%5Cn----%E3%80%8B%E8%BE%93%E5%85%A5123%20abc%E2%86%99%5Cn%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%E6%98%AF%EF%BC%9F%E4%B8%8B%E4%B8%80%E6%AC%A1%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%E5%8F%88%E6%98%AF%EF%BC%9F%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A16%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vHzYd%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card><h1 data-lake-id="ivWzu" id="ivWzu"><span data-lake-id="ua0eb299d" id="ua0eb299d">2.关键字和保留标识符</span></h1><p data-lake-id="423652228a8ff5e9716ad89849671354" id="423652228a8ff5e9716ad89849671354"><span data-lake-id="u3640fa5c" id="u3640fa5c" class="lake-fontsize-12">标识符：用来表示某种含义的符号（如同我们生活中的名字一样）。在C语言中，定义符号常量，变量，数组，结构体，枚举，函数等都需要一个名称，我们把这名称成为标识符。 标识符是程序员定义的名称，用来引用不同的数据类型和函数。  </span></p><p data-lake-id="e82fdfe66f00b8019de2cae7c2b89595" id="e82fdfe66f00b8019de2cae7c2b89595"><span data-lake-id="u1e2afc9c" id="u1e2afc9c" class="lake-fontsize-12">标识符的命名规则：</span></p><ul list="u89d4bf83"><li fid="u9555e879" data-lake-id="uaa1d713e" id="uaa1d713e"><span data-lake-id="ueb2633e2" id="ueb2633e2" class="lake-fontsize-12">标识符只能由字母，数字，下划线，美元（$）符号组成 </span></li><li fid="u9555e879" data-lake-id="ua9c2650c" id="ua9c2650c"><span data-lake-id="u5edcda5d" id="u5edcda5d" class="lake-fontsize-12">严格区分大小写 </span></li><li fid="u9555e879" data-lake-id="u6cea615e" id="u6cea615e"><span data-lake-id="u54b70106" id="u54b70106" class="lake-fontsize-12">不能以数字开头 </span></li><li fid="u9555e879" data-lake-id="uf3890656" id="uf3890656"><span data-lake-id="u182b28d7" id="u182b28d7" class="lake-fontsize-12">不能与C中的关键字同名</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ba5e71cd05d40818823fdeec548c925d" id="ba5e71cd05d40818823fdeec548c925d"><card type="inline" name="label" value="data:%7B%22label%22%3A%22eg%22%2C%22colorIndex%22%3A2%2C%22id%22%3A%22ojlgY%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card><span data-lake-id="u1eaa3f23" id="u1eaa3f23" class="lake-fontsize-12">：</span></p><p data-lake-id="uec22c11a" id="uec22c11a"><span data-lake-id="u7110778c" id="u7110778c" class="lake-fontsize-12">age、va123、_count、123abc、@abc、int</span></p><p data-lake-id="10785857b4e7ab37deada8840e9953bc" id="10785857b4e7ab37deada8840e9953bc"><span data-lake-id="uf2182ad8" id="uf2182ad8" class="lake-fontsize-12">关键字：关键字又称保留字，就是程序发明者规定的有特殊含义的单词，不能作为常量名、变量名或其他标识符名称</span></p><p data-lake-id="0ed5fd7a1eef279d36f7a99bafd8ba3b" id="0ed5fd7a1eef279d36f7a99bafd8ba3b" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F46168485%2F1735560084182-a500c388-74c9-487a-969a-7f5ad37b5a0e.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A634%2C%22height%22%3A881%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1234%2C%22originHeight%22%3A1715%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f2f2f1%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lX8dP%22%7D" class="lake-fontsize-12"></card></p><p data-lake-id="b5ca2ed168673f8503984ab627a85aab" id="b5ca2ed168673f8503984ab627a85aab"><span data-lake-id="ue8c32f23" id="ue8c32f23" class="lake-fontsize-12">分隔符：</span></p><ul list="u0c4d6679"><li fid="u6ddbd795" data-lake-id="u9ae83e57" id="u9ae83e57"><span data-lake-id="u4c2480e6" id="u4c2480e6" class="lake-fontsize-12">分号  ;  用来结束语句</span></li><li fid="u6ddbd795" data-lake-id="u5974725a" id="u5974725a"><span data-lake-id="u6692dd91" id="u6692dd91" class="lake-fontsize-12">大括号｛ ｝用来表示作用域，函数体，数组之中等等</span></li><li fid="u6ddbd795" data-lake-id="u619cb003" id="u619cb003"><span data-lake-id="u43b77d6e" id="u43b77d6e" class="lake-fontsize-12">圆括号 () 用在运算的优先级上，或者用在函数时包含参数列表</span></li><li fid="u6ddbd795" data-lake-id="u2977d395" id="u2977d395"><span data-lake-id="u94b1e12f" id="u94b1e12f" class="lake-fontsize-12">方括号 ［］主要用在和数组相关时</span></li><li fid="u6ddbd795" data-lake-id="u3c78ab66" id="u3c78ab66"><span data-lake-id="ubda68860" id="ubda68860" class="lake-fontsize-12">逗号 ，用于函数的参数列表分隔</span></li><li fid="u6ddbd795" data-lake-id="uae204614" id="uae204614"><span data-lake-id="u853ccce7" id="u853ccce7" class="lake-fontsize-12">点号. 用于点语法 -- 结构体章节会介绍</span></li></ul><h1 data-lake-id="DuSBp" id="DuSBp"><span data-lake-id="uc3320369" id="uc3320369">3.代码编写风格</span></h1><ul list="u196907a4"><li fid="uf060b4a4" data-lake-id="u4ec5da81" id="u4ec5da81"><span data-lake-id="u4ea432a2" id="u4ea432a2" class="lake-fontsize-12">缩进：凡是有代码块的地方都必须缩进，一对大括号 { } 代表一个代码块</span></li><li fid="uf060b4a4" data-lake-id="u05fabfd3" id="u05fabfd3"><span data-lake-id="u09f5f1df" id="u09f5f1df" class="lake-fontsize-12">空格：标点符号后面，一般加空格</span></li><li fid="uf060b4a4" data-lake-id="ub8b0baf6" id="ub8b0baf6"><span data-lake-id="u65b6c2ab" id="u65b6c2ab" class="lake-fontsize-12">空行：不同逻辑段落中间，一般加空行</span></li><li fid="uf060b4a4" data-lake-id="u08ad8687" id="u08ad8687"><span data-lake-id="u6b5be834" id="u6b5be834" class="lake-fontsize-12">符号命名：尽量能一望便知，做到顾名思义，避免使用无意义字符</span></li><li fid="uf060b4a4" data-lake-id="u926dbd23" id="u926dbd23"><span data-lake-id="u9b392ec6" id="u9b392ec6" class="lake-fontsize-12">华为c语言编程规范：</span><a href="https://ilcc.gitbooks.io/wiki/content/StyleGuide/Huawei-C/index.html" target="_blank" data-lake-id="u3f311e6d" id="u3f311e6d"><span data-lake-id="uc301fbfc" id="uc301fbfc" class="lake-fontsize-12">https://ilcc.gitbooks.io/wiki/content/StyleGuide/Huawei-C/index.html</span></a></li></ul><p data-lake-id="3dc26b48762ca225cc0d963300156b07" id="3dc26b48762ca225cc0d963300156b07"><span data-lake-id="u4094c5d8" id="u4094c5d8" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><h1 data-lake-id="dZfes" id="dZfes"><span data-lake-id="u27d64777" id="u27d64777">4.问与答：</span></h1><p data-lake-id="15f89cf5944d760551c3c2d969d317bf" id="15f89cf5944d760551c3c2d969d317bf"><span data-lake-id="uab2a83c9" id="uab2a83c9" class="lake-fontsize-12">GCC是什么的简称？</span></p><ul list="u032d841d"><li fid="uf973e8d9" data-lake-id="u55dc8e77" id="u55dc8e77"><span data-lake-id="ue28b88c7" id="ue28b88c7" class="lake-fontsize-12">GCC最初是GNU C compiler的简称。现在指GNU C compiler C ollection（开源编译器套件），这是因为最新版本的GCC能够编译用Ada、C、C++、 Fortran、Java和Objective-C等多种语言编写的程序</span></li><li fid="uf973e8d9" data-lake-id="u306a7ee7" id="u306a7ee7"><span data-lake-id="uf46d8f28" id="uf46d8f28" class="lake-fontsize-12">GNU指的是“GNU's Not UNIX!”，它是 自由软件基金会（Free Software Foundation）的一个项目。GCC和其他GNU软件对于Linux操作系统来说是至关重要的。Linux 本身只是操作系统的“内核”（处理程序调度和基本输入/输出服务的 部分），为了获得具体完整功能的操作系统，GNU软件是必要的，网站www.gnu.org 提供了更多有关GNU项目的信息</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="fc3199ccbd1cbe0936b333860aa3b661" id="fc3199ccbd1cbe0936b333860aa3b661"><span data-lake-id="ub147897f" id="ub147897f" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="bb79608726b5c9da65bb1a2e4af1e30e" id="bb79608726b5c9da65bb1a2e4af1e30e"><span data-lake-id="u05df34ba" id="u05df34ba" class="lake-fontsize-12">用gcc编译代码的方式是：</span></p><ul list="u8cc9c638"><li fid="u07868b10" data-lake-id="ud5a5919f" id="ud5a5919f"><span data-lake-id="ua7b53329" id="ua7b53329" class="lake-fontsize-12">例如写了一个xxx.c的文件</span></li><li fid="u07868b10" data-lake-id="u0bc09e20" id="u0bc09e20"><span data-lake-id="u32c3d11f" id="u32c3d11f" class="lake-fontsize-12">gcc xxx.c -o xxx</span></li><li fid="u07868b10" data-lake-id="uc91616fe" id="uc91616fe"><span data-lake-id="ue109e74e" id="ue109e74e" class="lake-fontsize-12">gcc 是编译器  -0 表示要输出的名称，不然就是默认名称a.out</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="94b664a4108595abf3301d9eefc99cc2" id="94b664a4108595abf3301d9eefc99cc2"><span data-lake-id="u49cb3686" id="u49cb3686" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="daac817cdaec5fb2fac83867a5a070ac" id="daac817cdaec5fb2fac83867a5a070ac"><span data-lake-id="u2600d48e" id="u2600d48e" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="8d4274db3edde715a9f8f1058b290bdc" id="8d4274db3edde715a9f8f1058b290bdc"><span data-lake-id="uaf838653" id="uaf838653" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="fc349ff3c6cc2a4f5a64a15f50d1ce2f" id="fc349ff3c6cc2a4f5a64a15f50d1ce2f"><span data-lake-id="ue01fb79f" id="ue01fb79f" class="lake-fontsize-12">在某些C语言书中，main 函数的结尾使用的是exit(0) 而不 是return 0 ，二者是否一样呢？</span></p><ul list="ucc5c272b"><li fid="ufa8796af" data-lake-id="ue674ad9f" id="ue674ad9f"><span data-lake-id="u7d2c9b17" id="u7d2c9b17" class="lake-fontsize-12">当出现在main 函数中时，这两种语句是完全等价的：二者都终 止程序执行，并且向操作系统返回0值。使用哪种语句完全依据个人喜 好而定。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="d432389870eded04c50df12890658a4f" id="d432389870eded04c50df12890658a4f"><span data-lake-id="u810ec438" id="u810ec438" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="768ab62558a13a744421d2ceb99709ae" id="768ab62558a13a744421d2ceb99709ae"><span data-lake-id="u95a69850" id="u95a69850" class="lake-fontsize-12">如果main 函数末尾没有return 语句会产生什么后果？</span></p><ul list="u7766e82a"><li fid="u0040fd4c" data-lake-id="u0d3779c3" id="u0d3779c3"><span data-lake-id="u37732247" id="u37732247" class="lake-fontsize-12">return 语句不是必需的；如果没有return 语句，程序一样会 终止。在C89中，返回给操作系统的值是未定义的。 在C99中，如 果main 函数声明中的返回类型是int ，程序 会向操作系统返回0 。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="c0670d7ff680c53681227f1913c87642" id="c0670d7ff680c53681227f1913c87642"><br></p><h1 data-lake-id="UPJ84" id="UPJ84"><span data-lake-id="uf8b46750" id="uf8b46750">5、作业</span></h1><p data-lake-id="u50143704" id="u50143704"><span data-lake-id="uc9a57547" id="uc9a57547" class="lake-fontsize-12">华为规范</span></p><p data-lake-id="u99368157" id="u99368157"><span data-lake-id="u58e0c004" id="u58e0c004" class="lake-fontsize-12">麻花疼</span></p><p data-lake-id="30263aecc9a9da2a1d4a7d890f76e0ab" id="30263aecc9a9da2a1d4a7d890f76e0ab"><br></p><p data-lake-id="28ca97751214f926cbd900248c038771" id="28ca97751214f926cbd900248c038771"><span data-lake-id="ud7c712bb" id="ud7c712bb" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="82631cffca07d3e87f041565cafe4a8f" id="82631cffca07d3e87f041565cafe4a8f"><span data-lake-id="ubf2b0245" id="ubf2b0245" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="e76d5b98f848b2c791d559ae7ffe1568" id="e76d5b98f848b2c791d559ae7ffe1568"><span data-lake-id="uf5743a46" id="uf5743a46" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p>